<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ABC College of Engineering</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #173b75, #2563a8);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 15px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #102a50;
            padding: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffd166;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        section {
            background-color: white;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        section h2 {
            color: #173b75;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2563a8;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .departments {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .department {
            background-color: #eef5ff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #173b75;
        }

        .news article {
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2563a8;
            background-color: #f5f8fc;
        }

        .news article strong {
            color: #173b75;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #102a50;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        footer p {
            margin: 6px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .departments {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            nav a {
                display: block;
                margin: 10px;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>ABC College of Engineering</h1>
        <p>Affiliated to ABC University | Accredited by NAAC</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#departments">Departments</a>
        <a href="#news">Latest News</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <main>

        <section id="home">
            <h2>Welcome to ABC College</h2>
            <p>
                ABC College of Engineering is committed to providing quality
                education, developing technical skills and encouraging innovation
                among students.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>
                Our college provides modern infrastructure, experienced faculty,
                laboratories and various opportunities for students to develop
                their academic and professional skills.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="departments">
            <h2>Departments</h2>

            <div class="departments">
                <div class="department">Computer Science & Engineering</div>
                <div class="department">Information Technology</div>
                <div class="department">Electronics & Communication</div>
                <div class="department">Electrical Engineering</div>
                <div class="department">Mechanical Engineering</div>
                <div class="department">Civil Engineering</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="news" class="news">
            <h2>Latest News</h2>

            <article>
                <strong>Admissions Open:</strong>
                Applications for the academic year 2026-27 are now open.
            </article>

            <article>
                <strong>Technical Fest:</strong>
                Annual technical fest will be conducted next month.
            </article>

            <article>
                <strong>Campus Placements:</strong>
                Leading companies are visiting the campus for recruitment.
            </article>

            <article>
                <strong>Sports Meet:</strong>
                Inter-college sports competitions will be held this semester.
            </article>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer id="contact">
        <p><strong>ABC College of Engineering</strong></p>
        <p>123 College Road, Hyderabad, Telangana</p>
        <p>Email: info@abccollege.edu | Phone: +91 98765 43210</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 ABC College. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
